// The two text boxes. The state is the truth about what they hold: a window shell copies what the learner types into the state as an event (gym_lead), and every paint puts the state's text back in the box (gym_follow), which is what keeps an answer fixed once it is committed.

// Make the text boxes hold the state's text: the typed answer in the answer box, the cool-down line in the note box.
gym_boxes_follow(Session gym_state) {
  gym_follow_box((import gym_answer_box), gym_state.texts[(import gym_text_answer)]);
  gym_follow_box((import gym_note_box), gym_state.texts[(import gym_text_note)]);
} return void;
